# AutoCast Cursor Rule

Before coding, classify the task using AutoCast intake and routing.

Use the smallest correct change. Preserve existing project patterns. Do not add dependencies or widen permissions without justification. Apply the security baseline to every change.

For sensitive changes, require security review before completion.
